OL,3,GNEWSASpecialist court opens for
OL,4,Adomestic abuse cases
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new specialist court has been opened
OL,7,Ffor domestic abuse cases, designed to
OL,8,Fmake the process less overwhelming and
OL,9,Fmore efficient for victims.
OL,11,FCornwall Council, along with criminal
OL,12,Fjustice agencies and support services,
OL,13,Fsaid the Specialist Domestic Abuse
OL,14,FCourt (SDAC) would hear cases at a
OL,15,Fdedicated court.
OL,17,FThe dedicated court sessions will be
OL,18,Fheard at Truro and Bodmin Magistrates'
OL,19,Fcourts where victims would have access
OL,20,Fto support from Independent Domestic
OL,21,FViolence Advisors (IDVAs).
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
