OL,3,GNEWSASpecialist court opens for
OL,4,Adomestic abuse cases
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority said it also aimed to
OL,7,Fimprove the way organisations worked
OL,8,Ftogether and ensure those committing
OL,9,Fdomestic abuse face the "consequences
OL,10,Fof their actions".
